<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<body style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif; color: #23272f;">
<div style="max-width: 500px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 20px;">
    <h1 style="color: #d64545; font-size: 20px;">Match annulé</h1>

    <p>Bonjour {{ player.firstName }},</p>

    <p>Le match suivant, pour lequel vous étiez convoqué, est annulé :</p>

    <div style="background-color: #F4F6F8; border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px; margin: 16px 0;">
        <p style="margin: 0; font-weight: bold; font-size: 16px;">
            {{ match.homeClub.name }} vs {{ match.awayClub.name }}
        </p>
        <p style="margin: 4px 0 0 0; color: #565c69;">
            {{ match.scheduledAt.toDateTimeImmutable|date('d/m/Y à H:i') }}
        </p>
    </div>

    <p style="margin-top: 24px; color: #8A99A8; font-size: 12px;">CA Venette — Message automatique</p>
</div>
</body>
</html>
